# SP+ coaching tips, stage 3 (second month): repeatable work. These only make
# sense to an advisor who has already had several wins, so they are gated on
# session count, not on the calendar.
m2-16	Describe a process you repeat, and Fin can turn it into a checklist for next time.
m2-17	Ask Fin to make a reusable template for your follow-up letters, with the changing details left ready to fill in.
m2-18	Ask Fin to prepare a complete meeting packet from the documents for one client.
m2-19	Fin can prepare a handoff for your assistant: what is done, what is waiting, and what happens next.
m2-20	Ask Fin to review a month's work and point out unfinished items, duplicate documents, or dates that do not match.
